# Why "pragmatic craftsmanship"?

*Craftsmanship* is a "spiritual" part.
It's about improving your skills. Improving you tools. To be good with your craft.

*Pragmatic* is because we exist in the world that has limitations.
We need to account for them. We need to adapt.
